  "description": "Kang Hyeon-Su, who got dumped after asking his girlfriend for a prostate massage. Hyeon-Su, a dopamine addict, was wondering if there was anyone who could satisfy his desires when he happened to run into Kwon Seo-Hyeok, a college junior who had come to his company to request a remodeling project. As the two shared drinks during their long-awaited reunion, they naturally ended up at Seo-Hyeok’s place...\n\nWhat Hyeon-Su encountered there was none other than a walk-in closet filled with “adult toys”?! His initial shock was short-lived, and as Hyeon-Eu showed interest, Seo-Hyeok, as if he’d been waiting for this moment, made a suggestive remark. \n\n*“I collected all of this to share with you, Senior.”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
